{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 12496738430015444769,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Concern",
      "source_hash": 17476137839099907459,
      "context_hash": 12048956366713810057,
      "translation": "우려 사항",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:22.781291Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The `concern` command is used to formally register a concern at the top comment of a GitHub issue/PR.",
      "source_hash": 1851531806043738474,
      "context_hash": 6421924505714297988,
      "translation": "`concern` 명령은 GitHub 이슈/PR의 최상단 댓글에 우려 사항을 공식적으로 등록하는 데 사용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:22.781292Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 15913565155765246626,
      "translation": "사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:22.781292Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A concern can be registered by writing a comment with the command:",
      "source_hash": 16902204920991424869,
      "context_hash": 11955340527313544505,
      "translation": "우려 사항은 다음 명령이 담긴 댓글을 작성하여 등록할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:22.781292Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The concern is then added in the top comment of the GitHub issue to a special section: `Concerns` (which should *not* be edited by hand).",
      "source_hash": 12632526512960532348,
      "context_hash": 14293190017552100719,
      "translation": "그러면 해당 우려 사항이 GitHub 이슈의 최상단 댓글에 있는 `Concerns`라는 특별한 섹션에 추가됩니다(이 섹션은 손으로 편집해서는 *안 됩니다*).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:22.781292Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "*Concerns can only be registered by member of the organization and cannot be registered on active [rfcbot FCPs](https://rfcbot.rs).*",
      "source_hash": 452846827794108426,
      "context_hash": 9743856792236948198,
      "translation": "*우려 사항은 조직의 구성원만 등록할 수 있으며, 활성 상태인 [rfcbot FCP](https://rfcbot.rs)에는 등록할 수 없습니다.*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:22.781293Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Resolving a concern",
      "source_hash": 10477995430340077499,
      "context_hash": 8545322115357007783,
      "translation": "우려 사항 해결하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:22.781293Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Concerns can be resolved by writing a comment with the command:",
      "source_hash": 17230209996749771796,
      "context_hash": 12307876326603852702,
      "translation": "우려 사항은 다음 명령이 담긴 댓글을 작성하여 해결할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:22.781293Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The concern is then strikethrough and a link to the comment resolving the concern is added next to it.",
      "source_hash": 3121570327922439373,
      "context_hash": 4093208910573533639,
      "translation": "그러면 해당 우려 사항에 취소선이 그어지고, 그 옆에 우려 사항을 해결한 댓글로 연결되는 링크가 추가됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:22.781293Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 10547672358125360712,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:22.781293Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "[!NOTE] This feature is [enabled by default](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/master/rust-lang.triagebot.toml) in the rust-lang organization.",
      "source_hash": 17648849861768685535,
      "context_hash": 3245126548997810291,
      "translation": "[!NOTE] 이 기능은 rust-lang 조직에서 [기본적으로 활성화되어 있습니다](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/master/rust-lang.triagebot.toml).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:25.014957Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature is enabled by having a `[concern]` table in `triagebot.toml`:",
      "source_hash": 9427919572187152729,
      "context_hash": 5155831482035546712,
      "translation": "이 기능은 `triagebot.toml`에 `[concern]` 테이블을 두면 활성화됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:22.781293Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 1316890553140144151,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:22.781293Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`parser/src/command/concern.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/parser/src/command/concern.rs) and [`src/handlers/concern.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/concern.rs).",
      "source_hash": 14313264081975427148,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`parser/src/command/concern.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/parser/src/command/concern.rs)와 [`src/handlers/concern.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/concern.rs)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
